        { "id": "directions", "labelPt": "Onde fica a sala de reunião", "prefixEn": "It's", "placeholderEn": "in room 204, next to the elevator." }
      ],
      "exampleEn": "This is James. He is our manager. He is very friendly. There is a cafeteria on the first floor. The meeting room is in room 204, next to the elevator."
    }
  },
